  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Continuation during 2001 of &quot;Nordpraktik - New Managers for Russia&quot; - a programme which started 1998 with the Norden Association as imple- menting Swedish party. Through the programme, approximately 100 young Russian managers at Russian companies will undergo a 3-week internshipat Swedish companies along with one week of training in management.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; praktikprogrammet &quot;Nordpraktik - New Managers for Russia&quot; under 2001. Programmet startade 1998 med F&#xf6;reningen Norden som genomf&#xf6;rande part och ger en m&#xf6;jlighet till 3 veckors f&#xf6;retags- praktik och 1 veckas ledarskapstr&#xe4;ning f&#xf6;r 100 yngre ledare inom ryskt n&#xe4;ringsliv.</narrative>
